===Etymology===
From earlier {{term||septmāginta}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|septm̥̄ḱomt|lang=la}}, from earlier {{proto|Indo-European|title=|septḿ̥-dḱomt|seven-ten|lang=la}}. Cognate with Ancient Greek {{term|sc=polytonic|ἑβδομήκοντα|tr=hebdomēkonta|lang=grc}}.

